```python
def sparse_categorical_accuracy(y_true, y_pred):
    y_true = K.cast(y_true, 'int32')  # Ensure y_true is cast to int32
    return K.cast(K.equal(K.argmax(y_pred, axis=-1), y_true), K.floatx())
```

